{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"c6975ca76f9f667f1250ba403d0e6da2aafe14d0","body":"## Summary\n\n- Correct the status of 30000166 and duplicate 30000167: the exact Möbius–totient eta-product positivity conjecture was proved by Berkovich–Garvan in 2006 and published in 2008\n- Match the original 2005 report to the full known proof, with explicit Fourier normalization, theta specialization, residue pairing, and all-integer coverage\n- Preserve attribution, source/version limitations, bounded reproducible checks, and 0/5 fresh proof-attempt accounting\n\nThis package makes no campaign discovery claim. The exact frozen artifact passed independent adversarial review. Shared queue updates belong to the parent workflow and should use one PR for both duplicate records.\n\n## Validation\n\n`python3 unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000166/verify.py`\n\n2,837 exact assertions pass. Independent adversarial review: PASS, with 35,980 additional exact assertions and no mandatory correction.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:32:08Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:32:08Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Audit known Saito eta-product positivity theorem and duplicate scope","oid":"d24ba1ce886d0ee0e2e7768974bce4323f49e0f0"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:42:05Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:42:05Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Package independent review of known eta-product theorem","oid":"b4d9dcf472d341b19b5766db01f748d69516a558"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:45:34Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:45:34Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Update queue status for 30000166 with reviewed PR outcome","oid":"8006d